msgid ""
"A scalar (yielding a 0-d tile), or a (possibly nested) tuple of scalars "
"whose nesting determines the tile's shape. Every tuple's length must be a"
" power of two, and sibling tuples at each level must have uniform length."
msgstr ""
"标量（将生成零维 Tile），或由标量组成的（可嵌套）元组，其嵌套结构决定 Tile 的形状。每个元组的长度都必须为 2 "
"的幂，且同一层级中各个同级元组的长度必须一致。"

